 "name_en": "Basic Cash Operations (BFB)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Basic Cash Operations (BFB)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioba6ab7c41e8c4ae7ab2befa8b9fc9dcc\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioba6ab7c41e8c4ae7ab2befa8b9fc9dcc__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Basic Cash Operations helps you to manage daily cash operations and provides general information of your current cash position and liquidity forecast.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can get a midterm liquidity forecast based on the projected incoming and outgoing payments and manually entered planning items.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Payment medium files can either be downloaded and sent to the banks manually or automatically sent to the banks via Multi-Bank Connectivity. This scope item supports handling bank statement manually.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioba6ab7c41e8c4ae7ab2befa8b9fc9dcc__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform bank integration for outgoing payment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform bank integration for incoming bank statement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View cash reports</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage memo record</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use cash tools</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioba6ab7c41e8c4ae7ab2befa8b9fc9dcc__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate outgoing payments with banks</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Retrieve bank statements easily</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor cash position and liquidity forecast centrally</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Establish manual planned cash flow items with Memo Records</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Various tools facilitate tasks such as flow aggregation, job scheduling, application log checking, and bank account balance reconciliation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>基本现金操作 (BFB)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioba6ab7c41e8c4ae7ab2befa8b9fc9dcc\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioba6ab7c41e8c4ae7ab2befa8b9fc9dcc__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">基本现金操作可帮助您管理日常现金操作，并提供当前现金头寸和流动性预测的基本信息。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以根据预计收款和付款以及手动输入的计划项目获取中期流动性预测。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">可以手动下载付款媒介文件并将其发送到银行，也可以通过 Multi-Bank Connectivity 自动发送到银行。此范围项目支持手动处理银行对账单。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioba6ab7c41e8c4ae7ab2befa8b9fc9dcc__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行付款的银行集成</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行收款银行对账单的银行集成</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看现金报表</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理备忘录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用现金工具</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioba6ab7c41e8c4ae7ab2befa8b9fc9dcc__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">集成付款与银行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松检索银行对账单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">集中监控现金头寸和流动性预测</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用备忘记录建立手动计划现金流项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">各种工具可简化各种任务，例如流聚合、作业计划、应用程序日志检查和银行账户余额对账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
